NOTICE — TTS Server (OmniVoice engine)
======================================

This project wraps the **OmniVoice** text-to-speech model published by k2-fsa
(https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice — Hugging Face: `k2-fsa/OmniVoice`).

