Third-party components inside the checkpoint
--------------------------------------------
- The audio tokenizer is **Boson AI's Higgs Audio V2 tokenizer**, distributed
  under a community license (built on Llama 3 components). Additional terms
  from Boson AI and Meta may apply to derived/generated audio services.
- The text model backbone inside the checkpoint is derived from **Qwen3**
  (Apache-2.0).

